<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">1 Pierre</para>
  <para style="toc1">PREMYE LÈT PIERRE</para>
  <para style="toc2">I Pierre</para>
  <para style="toc3">I Pi</para>
  <para style="mt1">PREMYE LÈT PIERRE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Pierre, yon apot Jésus Kri, a sila ki rete a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:11">I Pi 2:11</ref></char></note>letranje yo, ki gaye nan Pont, Galatie, Cappadoce, Asie ak Bithynie, sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:22">Mat 24:22</ref></char></note>ki chwazi davans yo, <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>selon konesans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:29">Wo 8:29</ref></char></note>davans a Bondye, Papa a, pa travay Lespri Sen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:13">II Tes 2:13</ref></char></note>pou nou ta kapab obeyi Jésus Kri e vin aspèje avèk san Li: Ke lagras ak lapè kapab pou nou nan pi gran mezi.<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Beni se Bondye e Papa a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:5">Tit 3:5</ref></char></note>selon gran mizerikòd Li, te fè nou vin ne ankò nan yon esperans lavi pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">I Kor 15:20</ref></char></note>rezirèksyon a Jésus Kris ki soti nan lanmò a <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>pou jwenn yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:32">Trav 20:32</ref></char></note>eritaj ki enperisab, san tach, ki p ap janm disparèt, ki rezève nan syèl la pou nou <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:28">Jn 10:28</ref></char></note>pwoteje pa pwisans Bondye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:8">Ef 2:8</ref></char></note>pa lafwa, pou yon sali ki prè pou revele nan dènye tan an. <verse eid="1PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:2">Wo 5:2</ref></char></note>Nan sa, nou rejwi anpil, malgre koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:10">I Pi 5:10</ref></char></note>pandan yon ti tan, si l nesesè, nou te twouble pa plizyè eprèv, <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>pou prèv lafwa nou an, ki pi presye ke lò, ki malgre eprèv dife a toujou rete perisab, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:7">Wo 2:7</ref></char></note>pou nou kapab twouve kòm rezilta, lwanj, laglwa ak lonè a revelasyon Jésus Kri a. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:29">Jn 20:29</ref></char></note>malgre nou poko wè Li, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:19">Ef 3:19</ref></char></note>renmen Li, e malgre nou poko wè Li koulye a, men nou kwè nan Li, e rejwi anpil avèk yon jwa ki pa kab eksprime e ki plen ak laglwa <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>ki fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:22">Wo 6:22</ref></char></note>kon rezilta lafwa nou an, sali de nanm nou.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:17">Mat 13:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Selon sali sila a, pwofèt yo ki te pwofetize lagras ki te gen pou vini a nou menm nan, te fè rechèch ak ankèt pa yo, <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>pou chèche konnen ki moun, oubyen a kilè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:21">II Pi 1:21</ref></char></note>Lespri a Kris la anndan yo a, t ap endike lè li te pwofetize soufrans a Kris ak glwa ki t ap swiv yo a.<verse eid="1PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Li te revele a yo ke se pa pwòp tèt yo ke yo t ap sèvi, men ou menm, nan bagay sa yo ke koulye a, gen tan anonse a nou pa sila ki te preche levanjil a nou menm yo pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:2">Trav 2:2</ref></char></note>Lespri Sen ki te sòti nan syèl la—bagay ke menm zanj yo lanvi konprann.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:14">Ef 6:14</ref></char></note>prepare panse nou pou nou kab aji; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:6">I Tes 5:6</ref>,<ref loc="1TH 5:8">8</ref></char></note> rete vijilan. Fikse esperans nou nèt sou lagras ki te pote a nou menm nan revelasyon a Jésus Kri a— <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Kòm timoun obeyisan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Wo 12:2</ref></char></note>pa vin konfòme nou a dezi lachè ke nou te genyen oparavan lè nou te nan inyorans lan, <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>men tankou Sila Ki Sen ki te rele nou an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:1">II Kwo 7:1</ref></char></note>se pou nou vin sen, osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 3:13">Jc 3:13</ref></char></note>nan tout konpòtman nou. <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/>Paske sa ekri: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Wo 12:2</ref></char></note>“Nou dwe sen, paske Mwen Sen.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Si nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:26">Sòm 89:26</ref></char></note>adrese kòm “Papa”, Sila ki jije san patipri a, selon zèv a chak moun, nou gen pou kondwi tèt nou nan lakrent pandan tan ki rete nou sou tè a.<verse eid="1PE 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Epi konsa, konnen ke nou pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:3">És 52:3</ref></char></note>rachte avèk bagay perisab tankou lajan ak lò ki soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:17">Ef 4:17</ref></char></note>mod de vi san enpòtans, tankou eritaj de zansèt nou yo, <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>men avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:28">Trav 20:28</ref></char></note>san presye, tankou sa ki sòti nan yon jenn mouton san defo, san tach, ki se san a Kris la menm. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Paske Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:23">Trav 2:23</ref></char></note>deja rekonèt avan fondasyon mond lan, men Li te vin parèt nan dènye tan sa yo pou koz a nou menm <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>ki pa Li menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:24">Wo 4:24</ref></char></note>kwè nan Bondye ki te leve Li nan lanmò e te bay Li glwa, pou lafwa ak esperans nou ta kapab nan Bondye.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Akoz ke obeyisans a verite a te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:8">Jc 4:8</ref></char></note>pirifye nanm nou pou yon lanmou sensè anvè frè nou yo, renmen youn lòt avèk yon chalè ki sòti nan kè, <verse eid="1PE 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>paske nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:3">Jn 3:3</ref></char></note>ne ankò, pa de semans ki perisab, men ki enperisab, selon pawòl Bondye a ki viv, e ki rete pou tout tan.<verse eid="1PE 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Paske:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:6">És 40:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Tout chè tankou zèb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">e tout laglwa li tankou flè zèb la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Zèb la fennen, e flè a vin tonbe,<verse eid="1PE 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>men pawòl Senyè a dire pou tout tan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:25">E sa se pawòl ki te preche a nou menm nan.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Ef 4:22</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 4:25">25</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 4:31">31</ref></char></note>mete sou kote tout mechanste, ak tout manti, avèk ipokrizi, lanvi ak kout lang <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18:3</ref></char></note>tankou tibebe ki fenk ne, se pou nou gen lanvi pou lèt pi a pawòl la, pouke pa li menm, nou kapab grandi vè sali, <verse eid="1PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3"/>si vrèman nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:5">Eb 6:5</ref></char></note>goute <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Sòm 34:8</ref></char></note>dousè a Senyè a. <verse eid="1PE 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Vin kote Sila ki kòm yon wòch vivan te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:7">I Pi 2:7</ref></char></note>rejte pa lèzòm, men ki chwazi pa Bondye, e presye nan zye Li.<verse eid="1PE 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Nou menm osi, kòm wòch vivan, ki bati kòm yon kay sen, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:6">És 61:6</ref></char></note>nou fè sèvis kòm prèt ki sen, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:16">Wo 15:16</ref></char></note>ofri sakrifis sen, ki akseptab a Bondye, atravè Jésus Kri. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/>Paske sa twouve nan Lekriti sen an:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:16">És 28:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Byen gade, Mwen poze nan Sion</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">yon wòch byen chwazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">yon wòch kwen prensipal la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">e sila ki kwè nan Li a p ap wont.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>Alò, valè presye sila a, se pou nou menm ki kwè, men pou sila ki pa kwè yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sòm 118:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Wòch ke bòs mason yo te rejte a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">sa te devni vrè wòch ang lan.”<verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>Epi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:14">És 8:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“yon wòch pou fè moun bite e yon wòch ofans.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 2:8">Yo bite konsa akoz yo dezobeyisan a pawòl la, e se pou move desten sila a, yo te deziye.<verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>Men, nou se yon ras chwazi, yon lòd prèt wayal, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:6">Egz 19:6</ref></char></note>nasyon sen, yon pèp pou pwòp posesyon Bondye, pou nou kapab pwoklame ekselans a Li menm ki te rele nou sòti nan tenèb la pou vini nan limyè glwa Li a. <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Os 1:10</ref></char></note>Paske, avan, nou pa t yon pèp, men koulye a, nou se Pèp Bondye a; nou pa t resevwa mizerikòd, men koulye a, nou resevwa mizerikòd.<verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>Byeneme, mwen ankouraje nou kòm vwayajè ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:23">Lev 25:23</ref></char></note>etranje yo, pou nou rete lwen lanvi lachè k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:1">Jc 4:1</ref></char></note>fè lagè kont nanm nan. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Kenbe kondwit nou pwòp pami pèp etranje yo, pouke nan bagay ke yo pale mal sou nou kòm malfektè yo, yo kapab akoz bon zèv nou, bay Bondye glwa, lè yo wè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:3">És 10:3</ref></char></note>nan jou gran vizitasyon selès la.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 13:1">Wo 13:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Soumèt tèt nou pou koz a Senyè a, a tout otorite ki etabli pami lòm, kit se yon wa kit se yon moun an otorite <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>oubyen a gouvènè ki voye pa Li menm yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:4">Wo 13:4</ref></char></note>pou pini malfektè yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:3">Wo 13:3</ref></char></note>louwe sila ki fè byen yo. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:17">I Pi 3:17</ref></char></note>se volonte Bondye, pou lè nou fè sa ki bon, pou sa fè inyoran yo ak san konprann yo rete an silans.<verse eid="1PE 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Se pou nou tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:32">Jn 8:32</ref></char></note>moun lib, e pa itilize libète nou an kòm yon kouvèti pou fè sa ki mal, men pito sèvi li kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:22">Wo 6:22</ref></char></note>sèvitè a Bondye. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:10">Wo 12:10</ref></char></note>Onore tout moun. Renmen frè nou yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 24:21">Pwov 24:21</ref></char></note>Gen lakrent Bondye, onore wa a.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:5">Ef 6:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sèvitè, se pou nou soumèt a mèt nou avèk tout respè, non sèlman a sila ki bon e dous yo, men osi a sila ki difisil yo. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Paske sa jwenn favè, si yon nonm, pou koz a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:5">Wo 13:5</ref></char></note>konsyans anvè Bondye, sipòte afliksyon ki enjis.<verse eid="1PE 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Paske ki glwa ki genyen si, lè nou peche e yo trete nou sevèman, nou andire li avèk pasyans? Men si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:17">I Pi 3:17</ref></char></note>lè nou fè sa ki bon e soufri pou li, nou andire li avèk pasyans, sa twouve favè devan Bondye. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>Paske nou te rele pou koz sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:17">I Pi 3:17</ref></char></note>akoz ke Kris osi te soufri pou nou. Li te kite yon egzanp pou nou swiv pazapa,<verse eid="1PE 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/>Sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">És 53:9</ref></char></note>pa t fè okenn peche ni okenn desepsyon pa t twouve nan bouch Li a. <verse eid="1PE 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/>Epi pandan yo t ap joure Li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">És 53:7</ref></char></note>Li pa t joure anretou. Pandan Li t ap soufri, Li pa t fè menas, men te kontinye mete konfyans Li nan Sila ki jije avèk ladwati a.<verse eid="1PE 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/>Epi Li menm te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">És 53:4</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:11">11</ref></char></note>pote peche nou yo nan Kò Li sou kwa a, pou nou ta kapab mouri ak peche pou viv ak ladwati. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">És 53:5</ref></char></note>ak blesi Li yo, nou te geri.<verse eid="1PE 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Paske nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">És 53:6</ref></char></note>toujou egare tankou mouton, men koulye a nou gen tan retounen a Bèje e Gadyen nanm nou an.<verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>Menm jan an, nou menm, madanm yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Ef 5:22</ref></char></note>vin soumèt a pwòp mari nou, pouke menm si nenpòt nan yo dezobeyisan a pawòl la, yo kapab vin konvenk san menm yon mo pa konpòtman a madanm yo, <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>lè yo obsève konpòtman nou ki moral, fidèl, e plen respè.<verse eid="1PE 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 3:18">És 3:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bote nou pa dwe senpleman a leksteryè, tankou nan trese cheve, mete bijou ki fèt ak lò ak bèl rad; <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>men tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:22">Wo 7:22</ref></char></note>sila ki kache nan kè a moun; avèk kalite enperisab de yon lespri dous e trankil, ki presye nan zye a Bondye. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Paske nan fason sa a, nan tan pase yo, fanm sen yo osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:5">I Tim 5:5</ref></char></note>ki te espere nan Bondye, te konn byen abiye yo, e soumèt a pwòp mari yo. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/>Menmjan Sara te obeyi Abraham nan, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Jen 18:12</ref></char></note>rele l senyè a, nou gen tan devni pitit li si nou fè sa ki bon e nou p ap pè anyen.<verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Ef 5:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nou menm, mari yo, menm jan an, viv avèk madanm nou avèk sajès, kòmsi avèk yon veso ki pi fèb. Ba li onè tankou yon moun ki pataje gras lavi a, pouke priyè nou yo pa bloke.<verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Anfen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:16">Wo 12:16</ref></char></note>ke nou tout vin amikal, senpatik, fratènèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Ef 4:32</ref></char></note>plen bon kè, e vin enb nan lespri.<verse eid="1PE 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Pa remèt mal pou mal, ni jouman pou jouman, men de preferans, beni moun nan. Paske nou te resevwa apèl la pou bi sa a, pou nou ta kapab eritye yon benediksyon.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luc 6:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>Paske:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:12">Sòm 34:12</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 34:13">13</ref></char>
    </note>“Sila ki dezire lavi a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">pou renmen e wè anpil jou ki bon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">dwe gade lang li kont sa ki mal</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">e lèv li kont bay manti.<verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:14">Sòm 34:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li dwe vire kite sa ki mal pou fè sa ki bon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">kite li chache lapè e pouswiv li.<verse eid="1PE 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:15">Sòm 34:15</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 34:16">16</ref></char>
    </note>Paske zye a Senyè a sou moun ladwati yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">e zòrèy Li atantif a lapriyè yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">men lafas Bondye kont sila ki fè mal yo.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 16:7">Pwov 16:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kilès ki kapab fè nou mal si nou montre zèl pou sa ki bon? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/>Men menmsi nou ta soufri pou koz a ladwati, nou beni. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:12">És 8:12</ref></char></note>Pa pè entimidasyon pa yo, e pa twouble. <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Men fè Kris sen kòm Senyè a nan kè nou. Toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:6">Kol 4:6</ref></char></note>rete prè pou fè defans bay tout moun ki mande nou pou nou rann kont de esperans ki nan nou an, men avèk dousè ak respè pou Bondye.<verse eid="1PE 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>Epi kenbe yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:5">I Tim 1:5</ref></char></note>bon konsyans, pouke nan bagay ke yo pale mal de nou yo, sila ki pale mal de nou an, akoz bon konpòtman nou nan Kris la, kapab vin wont. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:20">I Pi 2:20</ref></char></note>li pi bon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:21">Trav 18:21</ref></char></note>si Bondye ta vle sa, pou nou soufri pou fè sa ki bon pase pou fè sa ki mal.<verse eid="1PE 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Paske Kris osi te mouri pou peche yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:26">Eb 9:26</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 9:28">28</ref></char></note>yon fwa pou tout, Li menm ki te jis pou enjis yo, pou Li ta kapab mennen nou kote Bondye, deja mò nan lachè, men fèt vivan nan lespri a. <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>Ladann, Li te osi ale fè pwoklamasyon a lespri nan prizon yo. <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/>Se yo menm ki avan te dezobeyisan yo, lè pasyans a Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:3">Jen 6:3</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 6:13">13</ref></char></note>te toujou ap tann nan jou a Noe yo, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:7">Eb 11:7</ref></char></note>lach la t ap konstwi a. Se ladann kèk moun (sa vle di uit moun) te mennen rive sof nan dlo a.<verse eid="1PE 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>Sa se yon modèl pare ak batèm, ki koulye a ap sove nou—<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:14">Eb 9:14</ref></char></note>pa akoz li retire salte sou kò a, men akoz yon angajman anvè Bondye pou gen yon bon konsyans pa rezirèksyon a Jésus Kri a. <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:3">Eb 1:3</ref></char></note>Li menm ki, sou men dwat Bondye, te ale nan syèl, kote tout zanj, otorite, ak pouvwa yo te fin soumèt a Li menm.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Konsa, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:21">I Pi 2:21</ref></char></note>Kris te soufri nan lachè a, ranfòse tèt nou osi avèk menm bi a; paske moun ki deja soufri nan lachè yo, gen tan sispann fè peche, <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:2">Wo 6:2</ref></char></note>pou nou pa viv rès tan an konsa, nan lachè ak dezi a lòm, men viv pou volonte a Bondye.<verse eid="1PE 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:2">I Kor 12:2</ref></char></note>tan ki pase deja a, sifi pou nou te akonpli tout dezi a payen yo. Nou te konn pouswiv yon kous sansyèl, dezi chanèl, vin sou, banbòch, gwo fèt bwason, ak idolatri ki abominab.<verse eid="1PE 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Nan tout sa, yo etone ke nou pa kouri avèk yo nan menm eksè ki fè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:18">Ef 5:18</ref></char></note>dejenere konsa a, e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:16">I Pi 3:16</ref></char></note>pale mal sou nou. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Men yo va rann kont a Sila ki prèt pou jije <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:42">Trav 10:42</ref></char></note>vivan ak mò yo a.<verse eid="1PE 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:18">I Pi 3:18</ref></char></note>pou rezon sa a, levanjil la preche menm a sila ki mouri yo, pouke, malgre, yo jije nan lachè kòm lòm, yo ta kapab viv nan lespri selon volonte a Bondye a.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 13:11">Wo 13:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lafen tout bagay pwòch. Konsa, se pou nou vin saj, ak yon jan de panse byen serye pou nou kab priye. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/>Anplis de tout bagay, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:22">I Pi 1:22</ref></char></note>rete fèm nan lanmou nou youn pou lòt, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Pwov 10:12</ref></char></note>lanmou kouvri yon gran kantite peche. <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:2">I Tim 3:2</ref></char></note>Resevwa youn lòt lakay nou san plenyen.<verse eid="1PE 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:6">Wo 12:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Akoz chak moun gen tan resevwa yon don espesyal, anplwaye li nan sèvi youn lòt kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:1">I Kor 4:1</ref></char></note>bon jeran ak tout gras ke Bondye te bay la. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:1">Tit 2:1</ref></char></note>Nenpòt moun ki pale, li dwe fè sa tankou sila k ap pale pawòl a Bondye. Nenpòt moun ki sèvi, li dwe fè li tankou sila k ap sèvi avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:10">Ef 6:10</ref></char></note>tout fòs ke Bondye ba li, pouke nan tout bagay, Bondye kapab glorifye atravè Jésus Kri. A Li menm, apatyen laglwa ak pwisans, pou tout tan e pou tout tan. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Byeneme yo, pa vin etone de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:6">I Pi 1:6</ref></char></note>eprèv cho kap brile nan mitan nou an, ki parèt sou nou kòm yon eprèv, kòmsi se kèk bagay etranj k ap rive nou. <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Men nan menm degre ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:17">Wo 8:17</ref></char></note>pataje soufrans Kris la, kontinye rejwi nou, anfen ke nan revelasyon laglwa Li, nou kapab rejwi nou avèk gwo lajwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Si yo pale mal de nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:21">Jn 15:21</ref></char></note>pou non a Kris la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:11">Mat 5:11</ref></char></note>nou beni, paske Lespri laglwa a, ak Lespri Bondye a rete sou nou. De pati de sa yo, non L blasfeme, men sou pati pa w Li resevwa glwa.<verse eid="1PE 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Fè si ke okenn nan nou pa soufri kòm asasen, vòlè, oswa yon malfektè, ni yon moun k ap simen latwoublay<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:11">II Tes 3:11</ref></char></note>; <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Men, si yon moun soufri kòm yon Kretyen (yon moun k ap adore Kris), li pa dwe wont, men li dwe glorifye Bondye nan non sila a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:11">I Pi 4:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Paske li lè pou jijman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 3:2">Am 3:2</ref></char></note>kòmanse avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:6">Eb 3:6</ref></char></note>manm lakay Bondye yo. E si li kòmanse avèk nou an premye, kisa ki va rive a sila ki pa obeyi a levanjil a Bondye a?<verse eid="1PE 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 11:31">Pwov 11:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi si se avèk difikilte ke moun jis yo sove, kisa ki va rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:9">I Tim 1:9</ref></char></note>nonm ki san Bondye a, ak pechè a?<verse eid="1PE 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Konsa, sila yo osi ki soufri selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:17">I Pi 3:17</ref></char></note>volonte Bondye a lè yo fè byen, lese yo remèt nanm yo a Li menm kòn yon Kreyatè Fidèl.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Pou sa mwen egzòte ansyen legliz yo pami nou, mwen kòm yon ansyen parèy, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:48">Luc 24:48</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:5">I Pi 1:5</ref></char></note>temwen nan soufrans Kris la, e yon patisipan nan laglwa ki va vin revele a, <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/>se pou nou vin bèje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:16">Jn 21:16</ref></char></note>a bann mouton Bondye pami nou an. Gade sou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:14">Phm 14</ref></char></note>pa paske nou oblije, men paske nou vle, jan Bondye vle nou ye a, pa nan pouswiv move lajan, men nan dezi pou sèvi. <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Ni se pa tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:4">Éz 34:4</ref></char></note>kòmande sila ki plase anba otorite nou yo, men kòm yon egzanp pou bann mouton an. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Epi lè Chèf <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:25">I Pi 2:25</ref></char></note>Bèje a vin parèt, nou va resevwa kouwòn laglwa ki p ap janm gate a.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>Nou menm, jènjan yo, vin soumèt nou a lansyen yo. Ke nou tout, abiye nou avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:8">I Pi 3:8</ref></char></note>imilite youn anvè lòt, paske: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Pwov 3:34</ref></char></note>“Bondye opoze a ògeye yo, men Li bay gras a moun enb yo".<verse eid="1PE 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref></char></note>desann nou anba men pwisan a Bondye a, pou Li kapab leve nou nan tan konvenab la.<verse eid="1PE 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>Lage tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 55:22">Sòm 55:22</ref></char></note>tèt chaje nou yo sou Li, paske li sousye de nou.<verse eid="1PE 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 1:13">I Pi 1:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:42">Mat 24:42</ref></char>
    </note>Se pou nou gen lespri serye e rete vijilan. Lènmi nou an, dyab la, ap sikile toupatou tankou yon lyon voras k ap chache yon moun pou l devore. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Men reziste kont li, kanpe fèm nan lafwa, paske nou konnen frè kwayan yo nan mond lan, ap pase menm kalite soufrans yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:7">Jc 4:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Lè nou gen tan fin soufri pou yon ti tan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:6">I Pi 1:6</ref></char></note>Bondye a tout gras <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:9">I Kor 1:9</ref></char></note>ki te rele nou nan laglwa etènèl Li a an Kris, va, Li menm, fè nou pafè, konfime nou, e fè nou vin dyanm. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>A Li menm, pwisans pou tout tan e pou tout tan. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>Avèk èd <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:19">II Kor 1:19</ref></char></note>Silvain, frè fidèl nou yo (se konsa mwen panse sou li) mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:22">Eb 13:22</ref></char></note>ekri nou an brèf, pou ankouraje nou e bannou temwayaj ke sa se vrè gras a Bondye a. Kanpe fèm ladann!<verse eid="1PE 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>Madanm ki Babylone nan, ki te chwazi ansanm avèk nou an, voye bannou salitasyon li, tankou fis mwen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Trav 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref></char></note>Marc tou.<verse eid="1PE 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Salye youn lòt avèk yon bo lanmou. Lapè avèk nou tout ki nan Kris la.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:16">Wo 16:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
